ER Diagram:

                        +----------------------+
                        |        User          |
                        +----------------------+
                        | id (PK)              |
                        | name                 |
                        | email (Unique)       |
                        | password             |
                        | role                 |
                        | createdAt            |
                        | updatedAt            |
                        +----------------------+
                           ▲              ▲
                           │              │
              createdById  │              │ assignedToId
                           │              │
                           │              │
                  +--------+--------------+--------+
                  |                               |
                  |            Task               |
                  +-------------------------------+
                  | id (PK)                       |
                  | title                         |
                  | description                   |
                  | status                        |
                  | priority                      |
                  | dueDate                       |
                  | createdById (FK → User.id)    |
                  | assignedToId (FK → User.id)   |
                  | createdAt                     |
                  | updatedAt                     |
                  +-------------------------------+


Relationship:-

| Table | Relationship | Table               |
| ----- | ------------ | ------------------- |
| User  | 1 → Many     | Task (createdById)  |
| User  | 1 → Many     | Task (assignedToId) |




Database Structure:-

| Field     | Type            |
| --------- | --------------- |
| id        | Int (PK)        |
| name      | String          |
| email     | String (Unique) |
| password  | String          |
| role      | ADMIN / STAFF   |
| createdAt | DateTime        |
| updatedAt | DateTime        |
-------------------------------




Task:-

| Field        | Type                              |
| ------------ | --------------------------------- |
| id           | Int (PK)                          |
| title        | String                            |
| description  | String                            |
| status       | PENDING / IN_PROGRESS / COMPLETED |
| priority     | LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH               |
| dueDate      | DateTime                          |
| createdById  | Int (FK)                          |
| assignedToId | Int (FK)                          |
| createdAt    | DateTime                          |
| updatedAt    | DateTime                          |





Professional ER Diagram (for PDF):-

                    ┌───────────────────────┐
                    │         USER          │
                    ├───────────────────────┤
                    │ PK  id                │
                    │     name              │
                    │     email             │
                    │     password          │
                    │     role              │
                    │     createdAt         │
                    │     updatedAt         │
                    └──────────┬────────────┘
                               │
              creates (1:N)    │    assigned (1:N)
                               │
                ┌──────────────┴──────────────┐
                │                             │
                ▼                             ▼
         createdById                    assignedToId
                ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
                │              TASK               │
                ├─────────────────────────────────┤
                │ PK  id                          │
                │     title                       │
                │     description                 │
                │     priority                    │
                │     status                      │
                │     dueDate                     │
                │ FK  createdById                 │
                │ FK  assignedToId                │
                │     createdAt                   │
                │     updatedAt                   │
                └─────────────────────────────────┘




